    "turn_text": "I mean, I wonder what happens if it's possible that a year or two from now will have a number of members of the Senate who are people who will be looking for ways to not join the conference on votes, right? Because they'll be holding on, you see that dynamic happening in the House already. What happens then? What do you guys do?",
