    "turn_text": "in need of outcomes. And I think that I would challenge anyone to find someone else in Washington who is literally either than the primary bill writer are the person who ratified more conservative bills than I did in North Carolina in four years. So we can talk about the things that you may want to do. I remember in my time as partner at Price Waterhouse, we hired from the elite schools. You had to have a 3.5 GPA or better to even get an interview. You'd bring in a lot of these really bright, talented, energetic people that you concluded over time couldn't get anything done. They could talk about a lot of good ideas, but they could never actually implement them.",
