    "turn_idx": 124,
    "turn_text": "He's still very well regarded. He's a great Senate Armed Services Committee Chair. A lot of people, including me, were frustrated with that vote. But you just move on. That's one thing that I actually enjoy about this job. There are some things I don't. But I like the fact that it's sort of like my Carolina Panthers. They had a lousy game yesterday, an awful game. I can't believe we lost to the Bears. I'm back, I'm back watching the game next week and the week after that and the week after that and we'll have some good outcomes. So I think that's how you have to look at it. You can't let any one vote or position somebody takes lets you or cloud your judgment about the relationship you're going to have with them and finding the opportunities to work with them.",
