    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70874.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 138,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think that we have to look back in history when we've seen members of the minority shut down the government and how that worked out for them. And what we have to do is take a look and see, you know, what the basis of it would be. I",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
